WEBVTT

00:13:57.833 --> 00:14:00.419
Far from this idea of people
living all the time

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:02.504
in tiny bands of hunter-gatherers,

00:14:02.546 --> 00:14:04.381
actually, what we see these days

00:14:04.381 --> 00:14:09.928
is evidence for a really wild variety
of social experimentation

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.889
before the coming of farming.

00:14:11.889 --> 00:14:13.140
In Africa,

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:15.350
50,000 years ago,

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:19.771
hunter-gatherers were already
creating huge networks,

00:14:19.813 --> 00:14:23.025
social networks, covering
large parts of the continent.

00:14:23.442 --> 00:14:26.653
In Ice Age Europe, 25,000 years ago,

00:14:26.695 --> 00:14:32.743
we see evidence of individuals
singled out for special grand burials,